        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "After one second, the agent gives up and tries again. Ninety-eight dollars, refunded on a forty-nine dollar order." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "problem",
      "seconds": 13,
      "lines": [
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "No crash. No failing test. Under real-world failures, this agent keeps its rules only fifty-six percent of the time." },
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "And every other approach waits for it to break, then heals it." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "turn",
      "seconds": 13,
      "lines": [
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "Bulwark breaks it first." },
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "It's chaos engineering for AI agents. It attacks your agent before your users do, writes the fix, and only accepts it when an independent Judge proves it." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "attack",
      "seconds": 11,
      "lines": [
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "Red reads the code, finds the weak links, and attacks them in a sandbox. Timeouts. Rate limits. Prompt injection. A customer who claims to be the CEO." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fix",
      "seconds": 11,
      "lines": [
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "Blue writes a fix. The Judge re-runs every attack, on seeds Blue never saw. The first fix still pays twice. Rejected. Rolled back to a checkpoint." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prove",
      "seconds": 13,
      "lines": [
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "The second fix adds an idempotency key. Fifty-nine out of fifty-nine, enough to demonstrate a ninety-five percent target." },
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "Same seed, before and after. The second refund is gone." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "result",
      "seconds": 13,
      "lines": [
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "Fifty-six percent, to one hundred. Five hundred fifty-three thousand dollars at risk per thousand tickets, down to zero. Eight attempts, three rejected, and a pull request with proven tests." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tools",
      "seconds": 16,
      "lines": [
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "Every run is a neatlogs session, one trace per phase, and Blue reads failing traces back before it writes a fix." },
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "Entire names the AI session that wrote the bug. And the business plan is built in cfo.ai." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "different",
      "seconds": 14,
      "lines": [
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "It isn't tied to one agent. ResearchBot, on real Crustdata data: forty-nine to one hundred. Several faults at once: forty-three to one hundred." },
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "Bulwark even attacks itself. Eleven faults, eleven recovered." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "close",
      "seconds": 9,
      "lines": [
        { "voice": "narrator", "text": "Bulwark. Break it first. Agents you can trust to run without you watching." }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

